From: Farid Zakaria <farid.m.zakaria@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 21 Nov 2026 17:36:50 -0800
Subject: [PATCH 3/3] hw/i386: add the rewind machine

Rewind VM's deterministic machine, as its KVM monitor rewind-vmm makes
it: one vCPU of a fixed CPUID, a local APIC and nothing else, every
port access a step, and the monitor's ports, clock and interrupt. What
the guest reports goes to a step log that rewind encodes into its
trace.
